{
  "_comment": "Gmail newsletter farmer. Pulls AI newsletters automatically on a timestamp window: no starring needed. An email is kept if (1) its sender matches allow_senders, or (2) it is a newsletter (List-Unsubscribe / List-Id header) from a non-blocked domain whose subject+snippet hits >= min_keyword_hits AI keywords, or (3) include_starred and you starred it. Sender patterns are case-insensitive substrings of the From address.",
